flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Read user ID]
    B --> C{Empty?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Show error]
    C -- No --> E[Create ValidationService]
    E --> F{User ID valid?}
    F -- No --> G[Show invalid user ID]
    F -- Yes --> H{User exists?}
    H -- No --> I[Show missing user]
    H -- Yes --> J[Call Admin.viewClientDetails]
    J --> K[Call showClientDetails]
    K --> L[End]
    D --> L
    G --> L
    I --> L
